summary: Implemented VideoVisual as a first-class Visual type across 4 packages (types, schema, core, canvas). Added VideoFrameProvider injection pattern to the canvas renderer, videoSourceTime computation to the frame resolver, validateVideoLayer semantic gate in schema, and videoMeta to Asset. All 171 existing tests pass; all 4 packages build clean.
